    apply: "If you have not been baptised as a believer, talk to your pastor about it. If you have been baptised, remember your baptism and thank God, renewing your commitment to walk in newness of life. Read Romans 6 and note what it says about sin and freedom. Memorise Romans 6:4.",
    activity: "Read Romans 6:1-11 and discuss each image. Show images or demonstrate the symbolism with a water basin. Invite those baptised to share their testimony if they wish. Pray for those preparing for baptism.",
