    teacher: "Present views fairly and in line with your church's teaching without disparaging others. Make it clear that the call to examine oneself is not a call to despair or to stay away from the Table out of fear but to come with repentance and faith. Be sensitive to learners who are not yet baptised or members.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners what it means to examine ourselves and discern the body.",
    mcq1: ["What does 1 Corinthians 11:28 say?", ["Let a person examine himself, then, and so eat of the bread and drink of the cup", "Eat quickly", "Avoid the bread", "Eat alone"], 0, "Examine yourself."],
