    sa: ["How should believers approach the Lord's Supper?", ["examine", "repent", "reconcile", "unity", "reverent", "thanks"], "A good answer says believers examine themselves, repent and trust Christ, seek reconciliation, discern the body by caring for one another, and celebrate with reverence and thanksgiving, respecting differing traditions."],
